{"page":146,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:138","surah":6,"ayah":138,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟ هَـٰذِهِۦٓ أَنْعَـٰمٌ وَحَرْثٌ حِجْرٌ لَّا يَطْعَمُهَآ إِلَّا مَن نَّشَآءُ بِزَعْمِهِمْ وَأَنْعَـٰمٌ حُرِّمَتْ ظُهُورُهَا وَأَنْعَـٰمٌ لَّا يَذْكُرُونَ ٱسْمَ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْهَا ٱفْتِرَآءً عَلَيْهِ ۚ سَيَجْزِيهِم بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَفْتَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They also say, ‘These cattle and crops are reserved, and only those we allow may eat them’- so they claim! There are some animals they exempt from labour and some over which they do not pronounce God’s name [during slaughter], falsely attributing these [regulations] to Him: He will repay them for the falsehoods they invent.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they say","transliteration":"waqālū","verse_key":"6:138"},{"pos":2,"ar":"هَـٰذِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"These","transliteration":"hādhihi","verse_key":"6:138"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنْعَـٰمٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) cattle","transliteration":"anʿāmun","verse_key":"6:138"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَحَرْثٌ","en_gloss":"and crops","transliteration":"waḥarthun","verse_key":"6:138"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حِجْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"forbidden","transliteration":"ḥij'run","verse_key":"6:138"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"no (one)","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"6:138"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَطْعَمُهَآ","en_gloss":"can eat them","transliteration":"yaṭʿamuhā","verse_key":"6:138"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"6:138"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"6:138"},{"pos":10,"ar":"نَّشَآءُ","en_gloss":"we will","transliteration":"nashāu","verse_key":"6:138"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِزَعْمِهِمْ","en_gloss":"by their claim","transliteration":"bizaʿmihim","verse_key":"6:138"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَأَنْعَـٰمٌ","en_gloss":"And cattle","transliteration":"wa-anʿāmun","verse_key":"6:138"},{"pos":13,"ar":"حُرِّمَتْ","en_gloss":"forbidden","transliteration":"ḥurrimat","verse_key":"6:138"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ظُهُورُهَا","en_g